# ⚙️ Jenkins Pipeline Stages

```
Pipeline
 |
 ├── Checkout
 |
 ├── Gitleaks Scan
 |
 ├── Build Images
 |
 ├── Trivy Scan
 |
 ├── Docker Push
 |
 └── Deploy
```

---

# 🔐 Security Implementation

This project follows DevSecOps practices by integrating security checks directly into the CI/CD pipeline.

Implemented:

✅ Secret Detection using Gitleaks  
✅ Container Vulnerability Scanning using Trivy  
✅ Automated Security Gates  
✅ Secure Image Publishing  

---

# 🚀 Running Locally

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
```

Navigate to project directory:

```bash
cd project-name
```

Run application:

```bash
docker compose up -d
```

Check running containers:

```bash
docker ps
```

